message: "If you use POELIO in research or teaching, please cite the software repository and the specific commit you used."
type: software
title: "POELIO: A Literary Laboratory for Constrained Writing and Interactive Interpretation"
abstract: "An independent, literature-first research prototype with two original public teaching works, a six-stage reading and writing experience, and executable finite-model checks."
